## Stewardship

This file is approved at Gate C. Re-slicing (a change splits, merges, or is added) is a new revision: `git mv docs/openspec-slice.md docs/_archive/openspec-slice-{{old-date}}.md` and write the new one. Never edit silently mid-implementation.

`openspec-propose <change-id>` reads this file at start. If the requested change-id is not in the table, the propose command refuses (or run with `--no-slice` for ad-hoc changes that bypass the slice contract).
